"""
mp3tag - Automated Picard / MusicBrainz Metadata & File Renamer CLI
Downloads correct metadata from MusicBrainz (Picard database) and Cover Art Archive,
intelligently matches tracks based on folder name, track numbers, and track titles,
writes comprehensive tags, and renames files to standardized clean names.

Usage:
    mp3tag <folder>
    mp3tag <folder> -y                  # Non-interactive / auto-select top match
    mp3tag <folder> -n                  # Dry-run (preview changes only)
    mp3tag <folder> --cover             # Enable downloading & embedding cover art
